# The login screen's own session (docs/adr/0020-oxy-account-login.mdx): the login program's user,
# `oxyos-login`, signs in with no password and gets a logind session of class `greeter` on the
# seat (pam_systemd). No other user may use this service. Installed as
# /etc/pam.d/oxyos-login-greeter.
auth required pam_deny.so
account required pam_succeed_if.so quiet user = oxyos-login
@include common-account
session required pam_limits.so
session required pam_env.so readenv=1
session required pam_env.so readenv=1 envfile=/etc/default/locale
session required pam_systemd.so
